SC,0010
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F119A1788719151
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AGerman far-right set for big win in
OL,4,Aeastern state - projections
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe AfD has hailed the result as a
OL,7,F"historic outcome" and its charismatic
OL,8,Fleader in the state, Ulrich Siegmund,
OL,9,Fhas refused to govern with any other
OL,10,Fparty.
OL,12,FNo far-right party has won control of a
OL,13,Fstate in Germany since World War Two,
OL,14,Fand governing at state level would mean
OL,15,Fpowers over policing, local education
OL,16,Fand culture.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
