OL,3,ADozens feared trapped in collapsed
OL,4,Abuilding in Delhi
OL,5,
OL,6,FA residential building in the Indian
OL,7,Fcapital Delhi has collapsed with dozens
OL,8,Fof students feared trapped inside.
OL,10,FEyewitnesses told local media that as
OL,11,Fmany as 50 people were inside the
OL,12,Ffive-storey building in the Satya
OL,13,FNiketan neighbourhood of south-west
OL,14,FDelhi when it came down around 13:30
OL,15,Flocal time (08:00 GMT) on Sunday.
OL,17,FAt least three people were killed and
OL,18,Fthree others are in a critical
OL,19,Fcondition, news agency PTI reports,
OL,20,Fciting local police. At least eight
OL,21,Fpeople were said to have been rescued
OL,22,Fso far, according to reports.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
